---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const linkClass = "text-sm text-base-content/60 transition-colors hover:text-primary";
---
<footer class="border-t border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-6 py-12"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><a href="/" class="text-xl font-black tracking-tight">5bit</a><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/55">One home for gaming, being built for computers, TVs, handhelds, and mobile devices.</p></div><nav aria-label="Product" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-base-content/40">Product</h2><a href="/download/" class={linkClass}>Download</a><a href="/platforms/" class={linkClass}>Platforms</a><a href="/systems/" class={linkClass}>Systems</a></nav><nav aria-label="Project" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-base-content/40">Project</h2><a href="/docs/" class={linkClass}>Documentation</a><a href="https://github.com/RedRocDev/5Bit.one" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={linkClass}>GitHub</a></nav></div><div class="mx-auto mt-10 flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-2 border-t border-base-300 pt-7 text-xs text-base-content/40 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between"><span>&copy; {year} 5bit contributors.</span><span>Website code licensed under MIT.</span></div></footer>
